<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>MCPWM<sp/>Using<sp/>DMA<sp/>for<sp/>Advanced<sp/>PWM<sp/>Generation<sp/>{#EXAMPLES_DRIVERS_MCPWM_EX7_DMA}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[//]:<sp/>#<sp/>&quot;Short<sp/>Description:<sp/>This<sp/>example<sp/>demonstrates<sp/>how<sp/>to<sp/>configure<sp/>MCPWM<sp/>modules<sp/>and<sp/>DMA<sp/>controllers<sp/>to<sp/>implement<sp/>dynamic<sp/>updates<sp/>of<sp/>PWM<sp/>parameters<sp/>without<sp/>CPU<sp/>intervention.&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[//]:<sp/>#<sp/>&quot;Tags:<sp/>MCPWM,<sp/>DMA&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
